-- wave155c (28/09/26): the list comments follow the groups shape that wave155b introduced.
comment on table public.crm_lists is 'Saved lists of contacts for campaigns (wave155). A live list (kind dynamic) keeps its conditions in filter and is evaluated by crm_list_members() whenever it is read, so it follows the data; a fixed list (kind static) keeps member_ids, the people who matched when it was saved. Staff with the CRM page read and write.';
comment on column public.crm_lists.filter is 'The conditions as JSON (wave155b): {"groups":[{"all":[{"f":field,"op":op,"v":value}, ...]}, ...]}; every condition in a group must hold and a contact who matches any group is in. Fields and ops are listed on crm_contact_match(). The older flat shape (kind, role, act, perm, q, city, tags) still works through crm_list_preview_flat().';
